@page "/components/pricing-table"

<PageTitle>Pricing Table — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Pricing Table</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Plans and the features they include, after Kokonut UI's pricing table on 21st.dev: a
    monthly/yearly switch, the plans as cards to choose between, a comparison matrix with the
    chosen plan's column lit, and prices that count to their new value when the billing changes.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Basic</h2>
<Example Source="PricingTableExample.razor" Block><PricingTableExample /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">A form, not a widget</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The switch and the plan cards are radio buttons and the button submits them, so the whole
    table works with scripting off: <code>Action</code> receives <code>plan</code> and
    <code>billing</code> as a query string — sign-up or checkout reads them like any link. The
    shown price follows the checked billing through CSS alone. Script adds the lit column, keeps
    the button's plan name in step, and counts the prices.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Yearly, in another currency</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>Billing</code> and <code>SelectedPlan</code> set what is checked when the page arrives;
    <code>Currency</code> goes in front of every price. A price with cents is written with them.
</p>
<Example Source="PricingTableYearly.razor" Block><PricingTableYearly /></Example>
